            },
            {
              "key": "libaiModel",
              "label": "去AI味模型（建议与写作模型不同族，保证独立视角）",
              "type": "model",
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "key": "keep",
              "label": "去AI味时必须保留（默认保护引语与口径）",
              "type": "textarea",
              "defaultValue": "直接引语一字不动；数字、日期与口径标注不得改"
            },
            {
              "key": "intensity",
              "label": "去AI味强度",
              "type": "select",
              "defaultValue": "标准",
              "options": [
                {
                  "label": "保守（学术/公文，只删连接词与套话）",
                  "value": "保守"
                },
                {
                  "label": "标准（自媒体/公关，完整去AI清单+适度口语化）",
                  "value": "标准"
                },
                {
                  "label": "激进（创意写作/社交帖，可大改句式注入口语）",
                  "value": "激进"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "key": "model",
              "label": "写作模型",
              "type": "model",
              "modelTypes": [
                "text",
                "multimodal"
              ],
              "required": true
            },
            {
              "key": "evalModel",
              "label": "编辑评审模型（可选，建议与写作模型不同以保持独立视角）",
              "type": "model",
              "modelTypes": [
                "text",
                "multimodal"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "digest",
        "type": "llm-chat",
        "name": "素材消化与选材",
        "position": {
          "x": 260,
          "y": 320
        },
        "config": {
          "systemPrompt": "你是素材消化与选材编辑。任务：把素材整理成可直接支撑长文写作的选材方案。纪律：\n1. 只依据素材提取，禁止编造——每条事实/引语必须能在素材中找到原句依据；\n2. 叙事线候选 2~3 条：每条给一句话主线 + 为什么它成立（冲突/反差/悬念在哪）；\n3. 最强事实 ≤10 条：具体（时间/数字/人名/机构/结果）且对主线最有支撑力的，保留素材中的口径标注；\n4. 引语库：可直接引用的原话（注明说话者/身份与出处口径）；\n5. 口径冲突：素材中互相矛盾的数字/说法，两条并列 + 一句说明。\n素材为空时输出 {\"hasMaterial\":false} 全空结构，不要编造。",
          "prompt": "主题：{{start.topic}}\n写作侧重：{{start.premise}}\n素材全文：\n{{start.material}}\n\n请输出选材方案 JSON 对象。",
          "jsonMode": true,
          "providerConfigId": "{{start.model.providerConfigId}}",
          "modelId": "{{start.model.modelId}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "modePick",
        "type": "code",
        "name": "模式决策",
        "position": {
          "x": 480,
          "y": 320
        },
        "config": {
          "language": "js",
          "code": "const choice = String(inputs.modeChoice || 'auto');\nconst material = String(inputs.material || '').trim();\nconst hasMaterial = material.length > 0 || Boolean(inputs.digest && inputs.digest.hasMaterial);\nlet mode;\nif (choice === 'fiction') mode = 'fiction';\nelse if (choice === 'nonfiction') mode = 'nonfiction';\nelse mode = hasMaterial ? 'nonfiction' : 'fiction';\nif (mode === 'nonfiction' && material.length === 0 && !(inputs.digest && inputs.digest.hasMaterial)) mode = 'fiction';\nreturn { mode, hasMaterial };",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "key": "modeChoice",
              "value": "{{start.mode}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "material",
              "value": "{{start.material}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "digest",
              "value": "{{digest.parsed}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "angle",
        "type": "llm-chat",
        "name": "开篇钩子比选",
        "position": {
          "x": 680,
          "y": 320
        },
        "config": {
          "systemPrompt": "你是开篇设计师。为这篇长文设计 2~3 个开头方案并择优。钩子类型库：反差数字（用最悬殊的一组数据对撞）/ 场景切入（一个具体时刻的具体画面）/ 悬念设问（读者最想知道答案的一问）/ 时间锚点（把读者拉到决定性的一天）/ 引语开场（一句最有分量的话）。\n纪律：\n- 纪实模式下钩子必须取自选材方案里的最强事实/引语，不得虚构；\n- 小说模式按故事线自由设计；\n- 每个方案给出 why（为什么它能抓住读者）；\n- 择优 chosen 综合读者与文风判断。",
          "prompt": "主题：{{start.topic}}\n写作模式：{{modePick.result.mode}}\n读者：{{start.reader}}\n文风：{{start.style}}\n选材方案：\n{{digest.parsed}}\n\n请输出开篇方案 JSON 对象：{\"options\":[{\"type\":\"\",\"text\":\"\",\"why\":\"\"}],\"chosen\":{\"type\":\"\",\"text\":\"\"},\"reason\":\"\"}",
          "jsonMode": true,
          "providerConfigId": "{{start.model.providerConfigId}}",
          "modelId": "{{start.model.modelId}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "storyline",
        "type": "llm-chat",
        "name": "构思故事线/叙事主线",
        "position": {
          "x": 880,
          "y": 320
        },
        "config": {
          "systemPrompt": "你是资深长文策划。根据模式产出主线：\n【模式=fiction 小说模式】构思一条有起承转合、有核心冲突与张力的故事线：创意新颖、逻辑自洽、结构清晰。\n【模式=nonfiction 纪实模式】从选材方案的叙事线候选中择优或融合成一条叙事主线：只依据素材中的真实事件脉络，冲突与张力必须来自素材中真实存在的矛盾/反差/悬念；说明选择理由；不得引入素材外的人物或事件。\n开场执行开篇比选选定的钩子方案。结构清晰、分段写出关键节点。繁简按开关（{{start.traditional}} 为 true 才繁体）。只输出主线正文，不要任何解释。",
          "prompt": "主题：{{start.topic}}\n写作模式：{{modePick.result.mode}}\n设定/侧重：{{start.premise}}\n文风：{{start.style}}\n开篇钩子（开场必须执行）：{{angle.parsed.chosen}}\n选材方案（纪实模式的主线来源）：\n{{digest.parsed}}\n\n请构思主线。",
          "providerConfigId": "{{start.model.providerConfigId}}",
          "modelId": "{{start.model.modelId}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "outline",
        "type": "llm-chat",
        "name": "生成章节大纲",
        "position": {
          "x": 1080,
          "y": 320
        },
        "config": {
          "systemPrompt": "你是内容编辑，基于主线输出章节大纲。只输出 JSON 数组，不要任何解释或代码块包裹：\n[{\"title\":\"章节标题\",\"summary\":\"本章要点（一句话）\",\"facts\":\"本章可用素材要点（纪实模式必填：本章要用到的具体事实/数据/案例，摘自选材方案；小说模式留空）\"}, ...]\n章节数不超过目标；纪实模式必须让选材方案的最强事实/引语/口径冲突分配到具体章节（开篇章执行既定钩子，末章负责收束）；小说模式保持剧情推进逻辑。繁简按开关（{{start.traditional}}，true 才繁体）。\n每个章节的输出字段增加 \"hook\"（本章末尾的钩子/卡点：悬念、反差或未解问题，负责把读者推向下一章；至少两章设置卡点，末章负责收束或留开放问题）。开篇章必须执行既定钩子方案。",
          "prompt": "主线：\n{{storyline.content}}\n\n写作模式：{{modePick.result.mode}}\n目标章节数：{{start.chapterCount}}\n文风：{{start.style}}\n选材方案：\n{{digest.parsed}}\n\n请输出章节大纲 JSON 数组。",
          "jsonMode": true,
          "providerConfigId": "{{start.model.providerConfigId}}",
          "modelId": "{{start.model.modelId}}",
          "maxTokens": 8192
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "loop1",
        "type": "loop",
        "name": "逐章写作",
        "position": {
          "x": 1280,
          "y": 320
        },
        "config": {
          "listExpression": "{{parseOutline.result.sections}}",
          "emptyPolicy": "skip",
          "errorPolicy": "skip"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "chapter",
        "type": "skill-call",
        "name": "写作本章",
        "position": {
          "x": 1480,
          "y": 400
        },
        "config": {
          "skillId": "writing-styles",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "key": "topic",
              "value": "{{start.topic}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "material",
              "value": "{{start.material}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "style",
              "value": "{{start.style_card}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "platform",
              "value": "{{start.reader}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "word_count",
              "value": "{{start.wordCountPerChapter}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "extra",
              "value": "{{start.premise}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "current_content",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "key": "feedback",
              "value": ""
            },
            {
              "key": "section_brief",
              "value": "第 {{loop1.index}} 章「{{loop1.item.title}}」\n本章要点：{{loop1.item.summary}}\n本章素材要点：{{loop1.item.facts}}\n本章末尾钩子/卡点：{{loop1.item.hook}}\n开篇钩子（首章执行）：{{angle.parsed.chosen}}\n全文主线：{{storyline.content}}\n写作模式：{{modePick.result.mode}}（nonfiction=纪实锁定素材口径；fiction=小说模式自由写作）"
            }
          ],
          "providerConfigId": "{{start.model.providerConfigId}}",
          "modelId": "{{start.model.modelId}}",
          "maxTokens": 16384
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "concat1",
        "type": "code",
        "name": "合并成完整长文",
        "position": {
          "x": 1680,
          "y": 320
        },
        "config": {
          "language": "js",
          "code": "const chapters = Array.isArray(inputs.chapters) ? inputs.chapters : [];\nconst title = (inputs.title || '').trim();\nconst body = chapters.map(function (c, i) {\n  const text = c && c.content ? c.content : (typeof c === 'string' ? c : '');\n  const clean = text.replace(/\\n*【本章梗概】[^\\n]*/g, '').trim();\n  const head = (c && c.title) ? '## ' + c.title + '\\n\\n' : '';\n  return (i > 0 ? '\\n\\n' : '') + head + clean;\n}).join('');\nreturn (title ? '# ' + title + '\\n\\n' : '') + body;",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "key": "chapters",
              "value": "{{loop1.results}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "title",
              "value": "{{start.topic}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "factCheck",
        "type": "llm-chat",
        "name": "事实校验",
        "position": {
          "x": 1880,
          "y": 320
        },
        "config": {
          "systemPrompt": "你是事实校验员。\n【模式=nonfiction】把正文中的可核查断言（日期/数字/金额/人名/机构/地名/引语/排序）逐条抽取，与素材逐条对照：\n- 每条给 verdict：一致 / 偏差（写明素材原文与正确值）/ 素材未载（正文有而素材没有的具体断言）；\n- corrected 给出修正后的全文（markdown）：只改错误处——偏差改成与素材一致；「素材未载」的具体断言改为一般性表述或删除；其余一字不动；\n- 引语必须逐字与素材一致。\n【模式=fiction】无需校验：输出 {\"mode\":\"fiction\",\"checked\":null,\"issues\":[],\"corrected\":\"\"}。\n只输出 JSON：{\"mode\":\"\",\"checked\":{\"total\":0,\"matched\":0,\"deviated\":0,\"missing\":0},\"issues\":[{\"claim\":\"\",\"inDraft\":\"\",\"inMaterial\":\"\",\"verdict\":\"\",\"fix\":\"\"}],\"corrected\":\"\"}",
          "prompt": "写作模式：{{modePick.result.mode}}\n素材全文：\n{{start.material}}\n\n正文全文：\n{{concat1.result}}\n\n请执行校验并输出 JSON。",
          "jsonMode": true,
          "maxTokens": 32768,
          "providerConfigId": "{{start.model.providerConfigId}}",
          "modelId": "{{start.model.modelId}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "applyFix",
        "type": "code",
        "name": "应用校验修正",
        "position": {
          "x": 2080,
          "y": 320
        },
        "config": {
          "language": "js",
          "code": "const corrected = String(inputs.corrected || '').trim();\nconst draft = String(inputs.draft || '');\nreturn { draft: corrected.length > 0 ? corrected : draft };",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "key": "corrected",
              "value": "{{factCheck.parsed.corrected}}"
            },
            {
              "key": "draft",
              "value": "{{concat1.result}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "editLoop",
        "type": "loop",
        "name": "编辑评审循环（直到达标）",
        "position": {
          "x": 2280,
          "y": 400
        },
        "config": {
          "mode": "until",
          "stopExpression": "{{editPack.result.verdict}}",
          "stopValue": "pass",
          "maxIterations": 3,
          "errorPolicy": "skip"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "editEval",
        "type": "llm-chat",
        "name": "独立编辑评审",
        "position": {
          "x": 2480,
          "y": 480
        },
        "config": {
          "systemPrompt": "你是独立编辑（与作者不同视角），按读者体验给这篇长文打分并给出可执行差距。五个维度各 0~10 分：\n- hook 开头钩子：前三行能不能让人停下来（是否执行了既定钩子方案）；\n- pacing 节奏与信息密度：段落节奏是否交替、有无冗长空洞段；\n- factDensity 事实密度：具体事实/数字/案例是否充分，有没有连续抽象概括的空段；\n- language 语言与金句：表达是否流畅有记忆点，有没有可以打磨成金句的句子；\n- ending 收束：结尾是否有力量、是否回应了开头。\n读者：{{start.reader}}；文风：{{start.style}}。\nverdict 判定：total≥40 且无单维低于 6 → pass；否则 revise。gaps 最多 5 条按影响排序，每条给 chapterHint（哪一章/哪个位置）+ issue + instruction（具体怎么改）。\n只输出 JSON：{\"scores\":{\"hook\":0,\"pacing\":0,\"factDensity\":0,\"language\":0,\"ending\":0},\"total\":0,\"verdict\":\"pass 或 revise\",\"gaps\":[{\"chapterHint\":\"\",\"issue\":\"\",\"instruction\":\"\"}],\"overall\":\"\"}。评审对象是下方「全文」字段；若其为空则评审「全文备选」。",
          "prompt": "主题：{{start.topic}}\n写作模式：{{modePick.result.mode}}\n（纪实模式时以下选材方案可用于核对事实密度是否兑现）选材方案：\n{{digest.parsed}}\n\n全文：\n{{editLoop.prev.result.draft}}\n\n全文备选：\n{{applyFix.result.draft}}\n\n请评审并输出 JSON。",
          "jsonMode": true,
          "providerConfigId": "{{start.evalModel.providerConfigId}}",
          "modelId": "{{start.evalModel.modelId}}"
        }
